# 1. Executive Summary

This document formally closes **Phase 02 – Backend Infrastructure**.

The objective of this task is to verify that every architectural objective defined for Phase 02 has been completed, reviewed, documented, and approved for implementation.

This document serves as the official engineering handoff between the Infrastructure Phase and the Core Backend Development Phase.

No new architecture, business logic, or implementation SHALL be introduced during this task.

